{"hymn":"S532","parent":"E659","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"¡Oh, regocijaos! Anima el Señor","subtitle":"Aliento—Para regocijarnos en el Señor","syl":{"n1":"¡Oh,","n2":["re","i"],"n3":["go","m"],"n4":["ci","m"],"n5":["ja","m"],"n6":["os!","t"],"n7":["A","i"],"n8":["ni","m"],"n9":["ma‿el","t"],"n10":["Se","i"],"n11":["ñor;","t"],"n12":"Él","n13":["pue","i"],"n14":["de‿a","m"],"n15":["ta","m"],"n16":["du","m"],"n17":["ras","t"],"n18":["rom","i"],"n19":["per;","t"],"n20":"Su","n21":["san","i"],"n22":["gre","t"],"n23":["ver","i"],"n24":["tió,","t"],"n25":"¿ya","n26":"quien","n27":["ten","i"],"n28":["drá","t"],"n29":["te","i"],"n30":["mor,","t"],"n31":"Si","n32":["Cris","i"],"n33":["to","t"],"n34":["to","i"],"n35":["do‿en","t"],"n36":["to","i"],"n37":["do","t"],"n38":"es?","n40":"Dios","n41":"por","n42":["no","i"],"n43":["so","m"],"n44":["tros,","t"],"n45":"Dios","n46":"por","n47":["no","i"],"n48":["so","m"],"n49":["tros,","t"],"n50":"Dios","n51":"por","n52":["no","i"],"n53":["so","m"],"n54":["tros,","t"],"n55":"¿Quién","n56":["con","i"],"n57":["tra","t"],"n58":["no","i"],"n59":["so","m"],"n60":["tros?","t"],"n61":"¿Quién?","n63":"¿Quién?","n65":"¿Quién?","n68":"¿Quién","n69":["con","i"],"n70":["tra","t"],"n71":["no","i"],"n72":["so","m"],"n73":["tros?","t"],"n74":["¡Nin","i"],"n75":["gu","m"],"n76":["no!","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["¡Sé fuerte en Él! Gozoso en Su poder,","A diario sé firme y fiel;","Si asecha el mal, valiente y justo sé,","Y Dios tu fuerza ha de ser."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Confía en Su Palabra, que es veráz;","En Cristo está el Sí y el Amén,","Y aunque esta tierra un día pasará,","Él Sus promesas cumplirá."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["En Cristo habitad, seguro Su control;","Te dio vida eterna el Señor.","Ninguno jamás podrá arrebatar","El alma que Él redimió."]}]}